
12 Dec 2025 -- need to free up that hailstone list

For some obscure reason I just had to put in a hailstone
tracking list. Try 100 000 000 for kicks to see the machine
grind. Be sure to time it.

WARNING : the process blows up at 12327829503 due to uint64_t

A reasonably fast ORACLE Sparc S7-2 server takes a good long
while to get to the fail point : 

proteus$ /usr/bin/time -p /usr/bin/nice -n +18 ./collatz 1000000000000
